Package: feathermail
Version: @VERSION@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: prodocik <prodocik@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.10), libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, libsecret-1-0
Homepage: https://github.com/prodocik/feathermail
Description: Linux-native local-first email client
 Feather Mail is a GTK4 email client with IMAP, SMTP and local SQLite cache.
 .
 The shell needs GTK 4.10 or newer and the WebKitGTK 6.0 (GTK4) API, so it
 does not install on releases that only ship GTK 4.6/4.8 or the WebKit
 2.0/4.1 API series.
